<title>POLAND: Relpol Q1 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Relpol Q1 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Relpol preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			1.39  vs    1.52</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  2.57  vs    2.01</p>
<p>    net profit				1.70  vs    1.35</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Relpol SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				11.37  vs   10.03</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  8.13  vs    7.25</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				0.61  vs    0.51</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.27  vs    0.14</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    2.75  vs    6.93</p>
<p>    financial costs			 1.57  vs    6.44</p>
<p>    investment				3.09  vs    0.24</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
